<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman ups UPM Kymmene.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman ups UPM Kymmene.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forestry company UPM Kymmene was raised to &quot;market outperformer&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
